{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y部分段落的感受提示仍然过密，尤其S03，虽然分时出现减轻了同时阅读的负担，但连续接收大量提示仍可能分散听觉注意力；另外，部分话语压缩后丢失了X中更完整的因果和心理转折。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词放大加亮，让普通观众更容易迅速抓住每段人物心理变化的核心；感受文字按音乐节点出现，又把抽象情绪落实为具体的声音、节奏、力度、空间感和身体体验，比X一侧集中罗列短词更容易建立对应关系。尤其在回忆、惊醒、动摇、重新站稳这些转折处，Y的音乐细节更丰富，前后呼应也更明显。不过X的叙述保留了更多因果连接和心理推演，例如为什么怀念、为什么不敢回去、为什么最终决定继续生活，人物的行为动机解释得更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "854d9494-1419-4803-873a-b4cb7ec3c76e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002919174616Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:29:57.576363+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "908beb84c6347cbadc6353593a0d47b0b1ed5f735bc1c15ae8370772a8e02c64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668